{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ve confirmed the current implementation enriches every archive entry eagerly, but any provenance lookup exception still bubbles out and breaks the full archive response. Next I’m narrowing the exact seams for artifact-version, producing-process, and source-provenance failures so we degrade only the affected entry."}}
