tifact summaries, process current-material projection, referenced-artifact reviewability, and the story’s mapped tests/gates across Convex, server, and client surfaces.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[],\"openFindings\":[],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-1.1\",\"TC-1.1a\",\"TC-1.1b\",\"AC-1.2\",\"TC-1.2a\",\"TC-1.2b\",\"AC-1.3\",\"TC-1.3a\",\"TC-1.3b\"],\"unverified\":[]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"mockOrShimAuditFindings\":[\"No production-path mocks, shims, or fake adapters were introduced in the reviewed Story 1 surfaces. The only fakes observed were test-only harnesses such as `InMemoryPlatformStore` and fake Convex contexts under `tests/` and `convex/*.test.ts`.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"pass\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"Story 1’s read paths are aligned to project-scoped artifact summaries and process-local current refs: `artifactSummarySchema` now exposes only `artifactId`, `displayName`, `currentVersionLabel`, and `updatedAt`, the project-shell UI no longer renders ownership copy, `setCurrentProcessMaterialRefs` updates per-process current refs after same-project validation, `MaterialsSectionReader` filters artifacts by those refs, and `DefaultArtifactReviewService` allows review when the process currently references the artifact while preserving earlier-version provenance via `producedByProcessId`.\",\"Legacy ownership residue still exists in the out-of-scope durable write path: `convex/artifacts.ts` keeps `artifacts.processId` in the table shape and still patches it during checkpoint writes. I did not treat that as a Story 1 failure because the story explicitly scopes revision/write-path realignment to later work, and none of the reviewed Story 1 read paths rely on that field anymore.\",\"Repo validation remains consistent with the onboarding baseline: `guard:no-test-changes` is a scaffolded skip inside `green-verify`, and `test:e2e` is still a scaffolded skip inside `verify-all`.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/006-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-04-26T22:01:32.568Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-04-26T22:12:51.874Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/005-self-review-batch.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-self-review\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"e6563d47-3466-4db2-a222-0cf0a38c4e72\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"role\":\"story_self_review\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc2e-23f0-7411-9ad6-771bcf0ada4e\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc2e-23f0-7411-9ad6-771bcf0ada4e\",\"storyId\":\"05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states\"},\"outcome\":\"ready-for-verification\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states\",\"title\":\"Story 5: Reopen and Degraded Provenance States\"},\"passesRequested\":3,\"passesCompleted\":3,\"passArtifacts\":[{\"passNumber\":1,\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/002-self-review-pass-1.json\"},{\"passNumber\":2,\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/003-self-review-pass-2.json\"},{\"passNumber\":3,\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/004-self-review-pass-3.json\"}],\"planSummary\":\"Re-read the Story 5 handoff, full tech-design set, and test plan, then revalidated the existing workspace against the required reopen, degraded-state, and classification behaviors. The current implementation already satisfies the story and passes the story and epic gates, so no additional code changes were required in this turn.\",\"changedFiles\":[],\"tests\":{\"added\":[],\"modified\":[],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":572,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":0},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/server/review-workspace-api.test.ts tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts tests/service/server/observability.test.ts tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts tests/service/client/process-work-surface-page.test.ts --environment node\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/client/review-workspace-page.test.ts tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts tests/service/client/package-review-panel.test.ts tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts tests/service/client/review-workspace-api.test.ts tests/service/client/artifact-review-panel.test.ts --environment jsdom\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"passesRun\":3,\"findingsFixed\":[],\"findingsSurfaced\":[\"Residual architectural shim remains: review/process services still rely on high-level PlatformStore review composition methods such as listProcessReviewTargets and getProcessReviewPackage, whereas the tech-design end state called for moving that policy fully into review-owned services.\",\"Residual verification gap remains at repo level: test:e2e is still scaffold-only and guard:no-test-changes is skipped, so Story 5 evidence stops at unit/service/client/integration coverage rather than executable end-to-end coverage.\",\"Within Story 5 scope, self-review pass 3 did not uncover any additional functional omissions that block ready-for-verification.\"]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[\"PlatformStore still owns part of the review/package composition surface through listProcessReviewTargets and getProcessReviewPackage instead of the fully narrowed durable-facts-only boundary described in the Epic 5 server tech design.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Proceed to verification on the current implementation, and track a follow-up cleanup to retire the remaining PlatformStore review-composition shim and add executable e2e coverage when that repo lane is available.\"},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"self-review-pass\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/002-self-review-pass-1.json\"},{\"kind\":\"self-review-pass\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/003-self-review-pass-2.json\"},{\"kind\":\"self-review-pass\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/004-self-review-pass-3.json\"},{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/005-self-review-batch.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-04-26T23:47:12.979Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-04-26T23:48:04.172Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/008-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"pass\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"4b5be0c1-3cf5-424b-8c5a-e8359eccfdc4\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc31-a561-72a3-aea4-bfeecee1f4ad\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc31-a561-72a3-aea4-bfeecee1f4ad\",\"storyId\":\"05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states\"},\"mode\":\"followup\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states\",\"title\":\"Story 5: Reopen and Degraded Provenance States\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/stories/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-client.md\",\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/package-review-panel.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts\",\"tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\",\"tests/fixtures/package-snapshots.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Follow-up re-verification focused on SV-05-001 by re-reading the touched client reload path, the new package-member navigation test, the existing review workspace/package server behavior for unavailable members, and rerunning the story and epic gates.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[{\"id\":\"SV-05-001\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"`selectPackageMember()` now routes `PACKAGE_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` and `REVIEW_TARGET_NOT_FOUND` through `reloadReviewWorkspaceSelection()` instead of immediately setting a fatal workspace error (`apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1348-1385`). The new client test exercises a stale member 404 followed by a workspace reload and asserts the workspace stays open instead of falling into the generic failure state (`tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts:288-361`). That aligns with the existing server/bootstrap evidence that degraded package members remain visible within the workspace rather than collapsing the whole package (`tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts:868-901`; `apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts:393-410`).\"}],\"newFindings\":[],\"openFindings\":[],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-5.1\",\"TC-5.1a\",\"TC-5.1b\",\"AC-5.2\",\"TC-5.2a\",\"TC-5.2b\",\"AC-5.3\",\"TC-5.3a\",\"TC-5.3b\",\"AC-5.4\",\"TC-5.4a\",\"TC-5.4b\"],\"unverified\":[]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"mockOrShimAuditFindings\":[\"No material production-path mocks/shims were introduced in the touched surfaces; mocked fetch, fake auth, and in-memory fixtures remain confined to test code.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"pass\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"The prior blocker is closed in the production code path: stale package-member follow-up reads now use the same bounded workspace-reload recovery pattern as stale artifact-version reads.\",\"The new client test proves the no-collapse fallback path; the exact degraded package workspace shape remains primarily evidenced by the existing server/integration review tests.\",\"`verify-all` still ends with the scaffold-only `test:e2e` skip message, but the command completed successfully.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/008-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-04-27T00:00:50.779Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-04-27T00:03:01.326Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/04-cross-process-package-alignment/006-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"ok\",\"outcome\":\"revise\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"362abf87-6055-4eba-8a8b-422d47cfcef4\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc1f-2c9c-7061-91b2-e07aacecba38\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc1f-2c9c-7061-91b2-e07aacecba38\",\"storyId\":\"04-cross-process-package-alignment\"},\"mode\":\"initial\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"04-cross-process-package-alignment\",\"title\":\"Story 4: Cross-Process Package Alignment\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-index.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-process-work-surface.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-tech-design.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-code-map.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/stories/04-cross-process-package-alignment.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-client.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/test-plan.md\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/package-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/export.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/review-workspace.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts\",\"convex/schema.ts\",\"convex/packageSnapshots.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContexts.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts\",\"convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Verified Story 4 against AC-4.1 through AC-4.4 by reading the story, full tech-design set, test plan, onboarding baseline, and the touched durable-state/store/review/export code paths. I focused on package publication eligibility, current package-context durability and reopen seeding, pinned-version package review/export behavior, and the supporting regression suite plus Story/Epic gates.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-04-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Current package-context reads and writes are exposed as unauthenticated public Convex functions\",\"evidence\":\"`convex/processPackageContexts.ts` registers `getCurrentProcessPackageContext` as a public `query` and `clearCurrentProcessPackageContext` / `upsertCurrentProcessPackageContext` as public `mutation` handlers, and `convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts` exposes member enumeration as a public `query`; none of those handlers authenticate callers or validate a service key. `apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts` consumes them as server-side store primitives, while the comparable package snapshot publish/read path stays internal-only in `convex/packageSnapshots.ts`. As shipped, anyone who can reach the Convex deployment can read or overwrite another process's mutable package-building context, which breaks the story's process-scoped context guarantee and bypasses the Fastify control-plane boundary.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/processPackageContexts.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-4.2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-04-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Current package-context reads and writes are exposed as unauthenticated public Convex functions\",\"evidence\":\"`convex/processPackageContexts.ts` registers `getCurrentProcessPackageContext` as a public `query` and `clearCurrentProcessPackageContext` / `upsertCurrentProcessPackageContext` as public `mutation` handlers, and `convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts` exposes member enumeration as a public `query`; none of those handlers authenticate callers or validate a service key. `apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts` consumes them as server-side store primitives, while the comparable package snapshot publish/read path stays internal-only in `convex/packageSnapshots.ts`. As shipped, anyone who can reach the Convex deployment can read or overwrite another process's mutable package-building context, which breaks the story's process-scoped context guarantee and bypasses the Fastify control-plane boundary.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/processPackageContexts.ts\",\"convex/processPackageContextMembers.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-4.2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-4.1\",\"AC-4.3\",\"AC-4.4\"],\"unverified\":[\"AC-4.2\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/packageSnapshots.test.ts convex/processPackageContexts.test.ts tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts --environment node\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"mockOrShimAuditFindings\":[\"No production-path mocks, shims, or fake adapters were introduced in the Story 4 publish/review/export/package-context seams; the in-memory store and fake Convex contexts remain test-only evidence surfaces.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"`verify-all` passed, but the repo's `test:e2e` lane is still scaffold-only and prints a skip message, so integration coverage is the deepest executable end-to-end evidence for this story.\",\"Several Story 4 assertions are traceable by behavior rather than by test title because some package review/export test names still carry stale TC labels from adjacent chunks.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/04-cross-process-package-alignment/006-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-04-26T23:28:08.202Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-04-26T23:35:12.459Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/006-verify.json:1:{\"command\":\"story-verify\",\"version\":1,\"status\":\"blocked\",\"outcome\":\"block\",\"result\":{\"resultId\":\"f87102e1-1e54-40dd-b345-9cc79f384c99\",\"role\":\"story_verifier\",\"provider\":\"codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc31-a561-72a3-aea4-bfeecee1f4ad\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019dcc31-a561-72a3-aea4-bfeecee1f4ad\",\"storyId\":\"05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states\"},\"mode\":\"initial\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states\",\"title\":\"Story 5: Reopen and Degraded Provenance States\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-index.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-project-and-process-shell.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-process-work-surface.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-tech-design.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-code-map.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/stories/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-client.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/test-plan.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/001-implementor.json\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/progress/006-verify.status.json\",\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/browser-api/review-workspace-api.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/package-review-panel.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/review-workspace.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/package-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/readers/materials-section.reader.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-work-surface.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-page.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/process-work-surface.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Verified Story 5 against the story, full tech-design set, test plan, current onboarding baseline, review/package client and server code paths, process materials read path, and the main server/client/integration tests for reopen, degraded provenance, and error-classification behavior.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-05-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Stale package-member selections collapse the review workspace instead of reloading bounded degraded state\",\"evidence\":\"The client already has a workspace-reload fallback for stale artifact-version selections (`apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1019-1065`, `1188-1238`), but `selectPackageMember()` does not use it. On any `ApiRequestError` from `GET /review/packages/:packageId?memberId=...`, it patches `reviewWorkspace.error` directly (`apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1266-1352`). The server intentionally returns `404 PACKAGE_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` for an explicit stale member (`apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts:393-410`; covered by `tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts:557-585`), while workspace bootstrap intentionally preserves the package shell with `target.status: 'ready'` and `selectedMember.status: 'unavailable'` (`tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts:868-901`). Because `apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts:223-235` treats any `reviewWorkspace.error` as a page-level failure, the stale-member click path hides the rest of the package and available targets instead of showing the bounded degraded state that `apps/platform/client/features/review/package-review-panel.ts:65-96` already supports. Existing client coverage only exercises the artifact-version fallback (`tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts:321-390`); `tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts:168-244` covers only out-of-order successful responses, so this regression is currently untested.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts\",\"tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-5.2\",\"TC-5.2b\",\"AC-5.4\",\"TC-5.4b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-05-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Stale package-member selections collapse the review workspace instead of reloading bounded degraded state\",\"evidence\":\"The client already has a workspace-reload fallback for stale artifact-version selections (`apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1019-1065`, `1188-1238`), but `selectPackageMember()` does not use it. On any `ApiRequestError` from `GET /review/packages/:packageId?memberId=...`, it patches `reviewWorkspace.error` directly (`apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1266-1352`). The server intentionally returns `404 PACKAGE_MEMBER_UNAVAILABLE` for an explicit stale member (`apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts:393-410`; covered by `tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts:557-585`), while workspace bootstrap intentionally preserves the package shell with `target.status: 'ready'` and `selectedMember.status: 'unavailable'` (`tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts:868-901`). Because `apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts:223-235` treats any `reviewWorkspace.error` as a page-level failure, the stale-member click path hides the rest of the package and available targets instead of showing the bounded degraded state that `apps/platform/client/features/review/package-review-panel.ts:65-96` already supports. Existing client coverage only exercises the artifact-version fallback (`tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts:321-390`); `tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts:168-244` covers only out-of-order successful responses, so this regression is currently untested.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts\",\"tests/service/client/package-member-nav.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-5.2\",\"TC-5.2b\",\"AC-5.4\",\"TC-5.4b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-5.1\",\"TC-5.1a\",\"TC-5.1b\",\"AC-5.3\",\"TC-5.3a\",\"TC-5.3b\",\"TC-5.4a\"],\"unverified\":[\"AC-5.2\",\"TC-5.2b\",\"AC-5.4\",\"TC-5.4b\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"mockOrShimAuditFindings\":[\"No material production-path mocks/shims were found in the reviewed story surfaces; fake auth services, fake Convex contexts, and `InMemoryPlatformStore` usages remained confined to test files.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"block\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"Most Story 5 server/bootstrap behavior is already present in the branch; the blocking gap is localized to the client follow-up package-member selection path.\",\"Both verification gates passed, so the stale-member regression currently sits outside automated coverage.\",\"Traceability is somewhat noisy: several relevant tests still use older Story 6-style test names even though they provide Story 5 evidence.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/05-reopen-and-degraded-provenance-states/006-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-04-26T23:48:18.768Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-04-26T23:57:25.290Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/story-verification/04-materials-and-outputs/codex-review-round-1.jsonl:17:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_8\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\"sed -n '781,960p' /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/02--process-work-surface/tech-design.md\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"- pass that map into `convexTest(schema, modules)`\\n\\n| Scri